    <briefdescription>
<para>MUX Devicetree macro public API header file. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Pure devicetree helpers for the MUX subsystem: macros that resolve to preprocessor tokens (identifiers, cell values, node identifiers, struct <computeroutput>device</computeroutput> pointers via <computeroutput>DEVICE_DT_GET</computeroutput>).</para>
<para>Helpers that emit <computeroutput>struct</computeroutput> <computeroutput><ref refid="structmux__control" kindref="compound">mux_control</ref></computeroutput> or <computeroutput>struct</computeroutput> <computeroutput><ref refid="structmux__state" kindref="compound">mux_state</ref></computeroutput> initializers live in <computeroutput>&lt;<ref refid="drivers_2mux_8h" kindref="compound">zephyr/drivers/mux.h</ref>&gt;</computeroutput> because they require the full struct definitions at expansion site. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
